              "heading": "ZX Bank Ltd. – Branch Network in Coimbatore"
            },
            "text": "Coimbatore, known for its thriving industrial sector and vibrant urban communities, is served by a robust banking network from ZX Bank Ltd. The bank ensures comprehensive financial access through a well-planned distribution of branches across all major regions of the city. Customers can access full-service banking—ranging from personal finance to digital transactions—at conveniently located branches in North, South, East, West, and Central Coimbatore."
          }
